# Solo Merge Workflow

This is a single-maintainer project. Do not open pull requests unless explicitly asked.

When work on a feature branch is complete:

1. Merge the branch into the default branch (`main`) locally
2. Do not run `gh pr create` unless the user asks for a PR
3. Do not push unless the user asks to push

Prefer small feature branches for isolation, then merge them into `main` when the unit of work is done.
